      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In September, we announced a global default policy for generally available GitHub Copilot features and supported client capabilities on Copilot Business and Copilot Enterprise plans.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Starting today, we&rsquo;re gradually rolling out enforcement of the policy through October 26, so it may take effect at different times for different enterprises and organizations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Eligible features left unconfigured will be set according to the global policy.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Administrators can still make explicit choices for individual features at any time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The policy applies to eligible settings on &ldquo;Features & clients&rdquo; and &ldquo;MCP servers in Copilot&rdquo;.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can review your setting under AI Controls &rarr; Copilot &rarr; Default policy for new features .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For eligibility and exceptions, see the documentation on default availability .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Eligible generally available features and capabilities left Unconfigured will be set according to the selected global default of Enabled , Disabled , or Let organizations decide .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Subsequent changes to the default policy won&rsquo;t change feature policies that are already set.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If you opted into a preview that later becomes generally available, your choice will be preserved.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-22-global-default-for-copilot-features-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T20:44:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:21.178Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
